{"id": "1542841167303934013", "channel_id": "1542841167303934013", "author_id": "1470253170209853632", "author_name": "morimensstaff03", "content": "📅 可投稿时间：\n<t:1787846400:f>~<t:1795967940:F>\n\n稿件发布时间：\n<t:1787500800:f>~<t:1795967940:F>\n\n📌 重要信息： UGC创作征集分为两个投稿方向，守密人可将作品按投稿要求发布在任意社群平台\n\n发布作品后，请务必把链接填到对应投稿方向的问卷中！填写后才能参与活动\n\n✦同人投稿链接：\nhttps://wj.qookkagames.com/p/fWuVRU8Hw\n\n✦攻略投稿链接：\nhttps://wj.qookkagames.com/p/TJCqULZQ\n\n📝 点击长图查看详细投稿要求\n\n——✦——✦—— ✦✦✦ ——✦——✦——\n\n**🔥Morimens┊10,000 Silver reward! V2.6 UGC Creation Submission Campaign Launched!**\n\n\n📅  Submission Period:\n\n<t:1787846400:f>~<t:1795967940:F>\n\nContent Release Period:\n\n<t:1787500800:f>~<t:1795967940:F>\n\n📌 Key Information:\n\nThe UGC creation submission campaign is divided into two submission directions.\n\nYou may post your work on any platform, but please make sure to submit your work via the official survey to qualify for rewards.\n\n✦ Fan Art Submission Link:\nhttps://wj.qookkagames.com/p/fHsVcUtqm\n\n✦ Game Guide Submission Link:\nhttps://wj.qookkagames.com/p/DeiixEnk\n\n📝 Click on the long image to view detailed submission requirements\n\n——✦——✦—— ✦✦✦ ——✦——✦——\n\n**🔥 10000 은심이 콸콸콸! V2.6 UGC 창작 공모전 개최!**\n\n\n📅 참여 가능 시간:\n<t:1787846400:f>~<t:1795967940:F>\n\n작품 공개 시간:\n<t:1787500800:f>~<t:1795967940:F>\n\n📌 중요 정보: \nUGC 창작 공모는 두 가지 분야로 나뉘며, 수호자 님께서는 작품을 제출 요구 사항에 따라 아무 커뮤니티 플랫폼에 게시할 수 있습니다.\n작품을 제출한 후, 반드시 링크를 해당 투고 분야의 설문지에 기입해 주세요! 기입을 완료해야 이벤트에 참여할 수 있습니다.\n\n✦동인 참여 링크:\nhttps://wj.qookkagames.com/p/fARnBwrF3\n\n✦공략 참여 링크:\nhttps://wj.qookkagames.com/p/ey2aDd8U\n\n📝 길게 눌러 상세 제출 요구사항을 확인하세요.", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T10:19:58.888000+00:00", "thread_id": "1542841167303934013", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Gdoll_look", "emoji_id": "1459091434958360760", "count": 6}], "attachments": [{"id": "1542841170529615932", "filename": "UGC-_V2.6.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 25979718, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1542841167303934013/1542841170529615932/UGC-_V2.6.jpg?